  <task>Planning phase: map the request to a semantic blueprint with a goal, participants, action, agent, patient, constraints and acceptance checks. Identify essential missing information. Present a short actionable plan, needed resources and meaningful risks; do not implement merely because you were asked for a plan.</task>
  <output-format>A concise plan and acceptance criteria. Keep private deliberation internal.</output-format>
</poml>
